# Enter the pinned dev environment automatically via direnv. Everything that
# influences build, test, or runtime results must come from the flake; see
# .claude/rules/nix.md. Installing nix-direnv is recommended (caches the
# environment, much faster shell entry).
use flake

# Personal, uncommitted overrides (extra env vars, local tweaks)
source_env_if_exists .envrc.local
